  "article": {
   "id": "2106728342569250816",
   "title": "VIBE MANUFACTURING IS HERE",
   "created_at": "2026-10-04T13:25:00.000Z",
   "cover_media": {
    "media_info": {
     "original_img_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTyiQquWcAAX5dm.jpg"
    }
   },
   "content": {
    "blocks": [
     {
      "key": "5rjm2",
      "text": "For the FIRST TIME in HISTORY, you can describe a physical product in one sentence and, a week later, hold it in your hands, cut from metal and built to your exact measurements.",
      "type": "unstyled",
      "entityRanges": [],
      "inlineStyleRanges": []
     },
     {
      "key": "e79bj",
      "text": " ",
      "type": "atomic",
      "entityRanges": [
       {
        "key": 0,
        "length": 1,
        "offset": 0
       }
      ],
      "inlineStyleRanges": []
     },
     {
      "key": "18lcb",
      "text": "Why hardware was so hard",
      "type": "header-two",
      "entityRanges": [],
      "inlineStyleRanges": [
       {
        "length": 24,
        "offset": 0,
        "style": "Bold"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "key": "bif30",
      "text": "It describes itself. When it connects, it tells the agent exactly what it can sense and do, in plain language.",
      "type": "ordered-list-item",
      "entityRanges": [],
      "inlineStyleRanges": []
     },
     {
      "key": "f89ud",
      "text": "IIt reports its state constantly. Locked or unlocked, full or empty, open or closed, so the agent always knows what's true.",
      "type": "ordered-list-item",
      "entityRanges": [],
      "inlineStyleRanges": []
     },
     {
      "key": "cepa0",
      "text": "Note: I’ll be adding more hardware startup ideas to Ideabrowser.com over the next 30 days.",
      "type": "unstyled",
      "entityRanges": [
       {
        "key": 7,
        "length": 15,
        "offset": 52
       }
      ],
      "inlineStyleRanges": []
